Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] CTest to top level and install static library

(a) Upstream calls include(CTest) (= enable_testing()) only in
src/CMakeLists.txt. CMake generates CTestTestfile.cmake solely for the
directory that calls enable_testing() and its children, so running ctest
in the build root reports "No tests were found!!!" with exit code 0.
Hoist include(CTest) to the top level so the root CTestTestfile.cmake
exists.

(b) install(TARGETS mathicgb LIBRARY DESTINATION lib) only declares the
LIBRARY artifact: the static archive (ARCHIVE category) is never
installed. mathicgb.h hangs off the PUBLIC_HEADER target property with
no PUBLIC_HEADER destination and is never installed either. Declare all
three destinations.

Mirrors archives/m/memtailor/1.4 patch 0001 (same upstream layout flaw).

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -4,6 +4,8 @@
 set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)
 
 project(mathicgb VERSION 1.4 LANGUAGES CXX)
 
+include(CTest)
+
 option(enable_mgb "Build mgb" ON)
 option(with_tbb "use TBB for multithreading" auto)
@@ -45,8 +47,12 @@
 add_subdirectory(src)
 
 set_target_properties(mathicgb PROPERTIES PUBLIC_HEADER src/mathicgb.h)
 
-install(TARGETS mathicgb LIBRARY DESTINATION lib)
+install(TARGETS mathicgb
+  ARCHIVE DESTINATION lib
+  LIBRARY DESTINATION lib
+  PUBLIC_HEADER DESTINATION include
+)
 install(DIRECTORY src/mathicgb
   DESTINATION include
   FILES_MATCHING PATTERN "*.hpp" PATTERN "*.h"
